{"id":3451,"date":"2017-03-10T19:40:47","date_gmt":"2017-03-11T02:40:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=3451"},"modified":"2017-03-10T19:40:47","modified_gmt":"2017-03-11T02:40:47","slug":"just-a-few-miles-down-the-road","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/03\/10\/just-a-few-miles-down-the-road\/","title":{"rendered":"Just a Few Miles Down The Road"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Kathy and I heard about a nice drive we could take down into a canyon to Clear Creek, just a few miles down SR 260. \u00a0It started out as a dirt road off the state route, then became a dirt trail, then became a &#8220;rock&#8221; trail and finally down around through a lot of tight switchbacks to the &#8220;Bullpen&#8221; Day Use Area. \u00a0The creek is flowing fiercely since the snow melt is rushing through every crack and crevice it can find. \u00a0You can hear the rushing water in the video below.<\/p>\n<div style=\"width: 685px;\" class=\"wp-video\"><video class=\"wp-video-shortcode\" id=\"video-3451-1\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" preload=\"metadata\" controls=\"controls\"><source type=\"video\/mp4\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-09-19.07.38.mp4?_=1\" \/><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-09-19.07.38.mp4\">https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-09-19.07.38.mp4<\/a><\/video><\/div>\n<p>The ground is soaking up the liquid sunshine and still plenty of water rushing by to the rivers and irrigation ditches.<\/p>\n<div id='gallery-1' class='gallery galleryid-3451 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-full'><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-09-12.31.16.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/2017-03-09-12.31.16.jpg\" class=